# Git, IDE, and build metadata
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes
**/.github
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/HELP.md
**/README.md
**/target
**/build

# Databases & local persistent files (prevent leaking local data)
**/*.db
**/*.mv.db
**/*.trace.db
**/*.sql.bak
**/*.dump
**/*.dumpstream

# Backups and temporary scratch work
**/backups
**/backup
**/scratch

# User uploaded images and local files (do not leak customer or product images)
**/product-images
**/uploads

# Environment secrets and credentials
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/application-local.properties
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.jks
**/*.crt
**/*.log

# Operating system artifacts
**/Thumbs.db
**/[Dd]esktop.ini
**/.DS_Store
**/*.tmp
**/*.bak
**/*.swp
**/*~
**/ersdaulath*

